# Navigation and logo

- On the home page the logo has no link to that same home. Do not create a cyclic link for crawlers or people.
- On inner pages the logo links to `/` (or the site home URL).
- Do not duplicate the logo with a “Home” link to the same URL next to it.
- URL changes → `<a href>`. Action with no URL change → `<button>`. Forbidden: `div`+onClick, `a href="#"`, `javascript:void(0)`.
- External links: `rel="noopener noreferrer"`. If `target="_blank"`, the accessible name or visible text says a new window opens.
- Do not open inner sections in a new tab unless the user asked.
